# ALLOWLIST. This working directory will hold things that must never be
# published: the ROM input, ROM-extracted/derived game data (including the
# decomp's committed model/level/text C files), rendered frame dumps,
# recordings, builds, toolchains and reference clones (refs/).
# Only source, scripts and docs are tracked -- everything else is ignored by
# the leading "*" and has to be re-included explicitly below.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!dev.sh
!docker/
!docker/Dockerfile.sm64
!tools/
!tools/*.sh
!tools/*.py
# the asset split: packer, recipe derivation/emission, leak scan (numbers only, never data)
!tools/assets/
!tools/assets/*.py
!tools/assets/*.sh
!tools/assets/*.json
!tools/assets/untracked_includes.txt
# the launcher icon (our own drawing: miyoo/icon.svg -> miyoo/icon.png)
!miyoo/icon.svg
# the Miyoo Mini release (the shared Miyoo kit: the packer, the launch templates, the port's game.json)
!miyoo/
!miyoo/game.json
!miyoo/templates/
!miyoo/templates/*
!miyoo/tools/
!miyoo/tools/*.py
!README_MIYOO.md
# The port tree: sm64-port @ 2b17d08 (2024-11-15), the n64decomp/sm64 decomp plus the
# PC port layer. CODE ONLY is tracked. The decomp's committed ROM-derived game data is
# fetched from that pinned commit by tools/decomp_data.sh (user-approved 2026-09-24),
# kept untracked here, and never shipped (NOLOAD asset region + leak-scan gates):
!port/
!port/**
port/actors/
port/levels/
port/assets/
port/bin/
port/data/
port/text/
port/sound/
port/textures/
port/assets.json
port/src/goddard/dynlists/
port/include/trig_tables.inc.c
port/include/text_strings.h.in
port/include/text_menu_strings.h.in
# N64-only: IPL3/boot/header asm, RSP microcode source, SDK microcode binaries, the
# IRIX compiler binaries, the upstream enhancement patches (one binary font), images.
port/asm/
port/rsp/
port/lib/PR/
port/tools/ido5.3_compiler/
port/enhancements/
port/doxygen/
port/build/
port/baserom*
# Never tracked anywhere (last, so they win over any re-include above):
# ROMs, builds, dumps, recordings, binaries.
*.z64
*.n64
*.v64
*.rom
*.mp4
*.log
*.core
core
core.*
*.ppm
*.png
*.wav
*.bin
*.sav
.DS_Store
._*
# the launcher icon (our own drawing, miyoo/icon.svg), re-included after *.png
!miyoo/icon.png
# the Miyoo64 repository's docs
!SETTINGS.md
